WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.474
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.474 --> 00:00:04.596
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:04.596 --> 00:00:08.096
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:08.096 --> 00:00:08.415
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:08.415 --> 00:00:10.420
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.927
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:14.053 --> 00:00:17.869
Open a hint before answering the tokenizer question.

00:00:17.869 --> 00:00:22.713
Choose the embedding-vector option to inspect incorrect-answer feedback.

00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:26.010
Read the explanation, then advance to the context question.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:29.901
Open a hint for the context intervention.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:34.937
Choose the available-context answer and read the correct feedback.

00:00:34.937 --> 00:00:38.250
Advance to the final question about parameters.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.242
Read a hint for the relationship between retrieval and model parameters.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:47.181
Choose the explanation distinguishing external context from parameter updates.

00:00:47.181 --> 00:00:50.474
Finish the quiz and inspect the result of all three answers.

00:00:50.474 --> 00:00:55.650
Review the 2/3 summary and the explanation of the earlier mistake.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:00.158
Restart the same quiz to practise the difficult concept again.

00:01:00.158 --> 00:01:07.140
Correct the earlier mistake by selecting numerical token identifiers.
